---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout 
  title="Fragile Base – Digital Flagship & Contemporary Commerce — Dennis Essien"
  description="Designing a tactile digital commerce experience for Fragile Base, an avant-garde fashion house balancing structural durability and intimate delicacy."
>
  <article class="project-detail">
    <div class="project-detail__inner">
      <a href="/work" class="project-detail__back">← Back to Work</a>

      <header class="project-detail__header">
        <div class="project-detail__tags">
          <span class="project-detail__tag"># E-Commerce</span>
          <span class="project-detail__tag"># Brand Direction</span>
          <span class="project-detail__tag"># Digital Flagship</span>
          <span class="project-detail__tag"># UI/UX Design</span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="project-detail__title">Fragile Base</h1>
        <p class="project-detail__tagline">
          Contemporary fashion house digital commerce experience — translating structural tailoring, organic textures, and emotional vulnerability into a high-converting digital flagship.
        </p>

        <div class="project-detail__meta">
          <div class="project-detail__meta-item">
            <span class="project-detail__meta-label">Client</span>
            <span class="project-detail__meta-value">Fragile Base Atelier</span>
          </div>
          <div class="project-detail__meta-item">
            <span class="project-detail__meta-label">Role / Scope</span>
            <span class="project-detail__meta-value">Lead Product & UX Designer</span>
          </div>
          <div class="project-detail__meta-item">
            <span class="project-detail__meta-label">Timeline</span>
            <span class="project-detail__meta-value">7 Weeks (2025)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="project-detail__meta-item">
            <span class="project-detail__meta-label">Platform</span>
            <span class="project-detail__meta-value">Headless Shopify & Web</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </header>

      <!-- Full-Width Hero Visual Showcase -->
      <div class="project-detail__hero-showcase">
        <img 
          src="/images/projects/fragile-base/hero_showcase.webp" 
          alt="Fragile Base digital flagship hero showcase with editorial typography and garment lookbook"
          loading="eager"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </div>

      <!-- SECTION 1: PROJECT BRIEF -->
      <section class="project-detail__section">
        <div class="project-detail__section-grid">
          <aside class="project-detail__section-sidebar">
            <div class="project-detail__badge">
              <span>01 / Project Brief</span>
            </div>
          </aside>
          <div class="project-detail__section-body">
            <h2 class="project-detail__section-headline">
              Translating architectural duality into an immersive, editorial e-commerce flagship.
            </h2>
            <p>
              Fragile Base is an independent fashion house exploring contemporary tailoring through tactile silhouettes, thoughtful sustainability, and unyielding emotional expression. Built on the core philosophy that garments carry cultural responsibility far beyond surface aesthetics, the label creates pieces that embody a living paradox: structural architectural strength paired with intimate human vulnerability.
            </p>
            <p>
              Our design objective was crafting a digital flagship that bridges high-fashion editorial storytelling with frictionless commercial mechanics. The platform needed to celebrate the raw materiality of wool, organic silk, and sculpted leather while enabling international patrons to discover, evaluate, and purchase specialized garments with total confidence.
            </p>

            <div class="project-detail__cards-grid">
              <div class="project-detail__card">
                <h4>Core Objective</h4>
                <p>Deliver an editorial shopping experience that conveys physical garment weight, fabric drape, and artisan provenance without slowing down transactional velocity.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="project-detail__card">
                <h4>Design Principles</h4>
                <p>Radical whitespace, tactile micro-interactions, responsive lookbook storytelling, and zero-distraction checkout flows.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="project-detail__media-single">
          <img 
            src="/images/projects/fragile-base/hero_dark.webp" 
            alt="Fragile Base dark editorial presentation and collection showcase"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
          <div class="project-detail__caption">Editorial Interface — Monochromatic Lookbook Presentation & Micro-Interactions</div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- SECTION 2: THE PROBLEM -->
      <section class="project-detail__section">
        <div class="project-detail__section-grid">
          <aside class="project-detail__section-sidebar">
            <div class="project-detail__badge project-detail__badge--alert">
              <span>02 / The Problem</span>
            </div>
          </aside>
          <div class="project-detail__section-body">
            <h2 class="project-detail__section-headline">
              The high-fashion dilemma: artistic storytelling at the expense of purchasing fluidity.
            </h2>
            <p>
              Luxury fashion websites consistently fail in one of two directions: they either indulge in sprawling, experimental art direction that bewilders shoppers with non-standard navigation and broken back buttons, or they dilute brand aura by stuffing avant-garde garments into generic, discount-style catalog grids.
            </p>
            <p>
              Heuristic audits and patron feedback revealed critical friction points in Fragile Base's earlier touchpoints:
            </p>

            <div class="project-detail__cards-grid">
              <div class="project-detail__card">
                <h4>Sensory Disconnect & Sizing Ambiguity</h4>
                <p>Shoppers couldn't gauge texture, weight, or fit flexibility. Asymmetric cuts and structural seams caused hesitation, driving a 34% drop-off on product detail pages.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="project-detail__card">
                <h4>Navigation Fragmentation</h4>
                <p>Editorial campaigns and seasonal lookbooks lived in detached silos from the actual catalog, forcing shoppers to re-orient themselves whenever they wished to purchase a featured piece.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="project-detail__card">
                <h4>Cart & Checkout Friction</h4>
                <p>Multi-step redirects and jarring full-page cart loads broke the luxury atmosphere and contributed to high cart abandonment rates on mobile devices.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- SECTION 3: THE SOLUTION & UX STRATEGY -->
      <section class="project-detail__section">
        <div class="project-detail__section-grid">
          <aside class="project-detail__section-sidebar">
            <div class="project-detail__badge project-detail__badge--success">
              <span>03 / The Solution</span>
            </div>
          </aside>
          <div class="project-detail__section-body">
            <h2 class="project-detail__section-headline">
              A bespoke layout architecture: tactile lookbook navigation, dynamic drawer ergonomics, and seamless commerce.
            </h2>
            <p>
              To solve the tension between brand prestige and commercial momentum, we designed a cohesive system where storytelling and shopping occur within the exact same spatial context:
            </p>

            <div class="project-detail__cards-grid">
              <div class="project-detail__card">
                <h4>Pillar 1: Tactile Lookbook Grid</h4>
                <p>Interactive editorial lookbooks allow customers to click seamlessly from runway shots directly into detailed fabric drape studies, garment provenance, and instant size selection.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="project-detail__card">
                <h4>Pillar 2: Slide-Out Tactile Cart Drawer</h4>
                <p>Replaced full-page cart redirects with an ergonomic slide-out drawer featuring instant size toggles, dynamic shipping calculation, and frictionless one-page checkout.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="project-detail__card">
                <h4>Pillar 3: Materiality Zoom & Fit System</h4>
                <p>High-resolution zoom states showing yarn counts, stitch density, and 3-point model sizing references that eliminate guesswork for international buyers.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- VISUAL GALLERY OF WORK -->
        <div class="project-detail__gallery-block">
          <div class="project-detail__gallery-grid project-detail__gallery-grid--2col">
            <div class="project-detail__gallery-item">
              <img src="/images/projects/fragile-base/fragile_01.webp" alt="Runway Editorial Spring/Summer Campaign" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
              <div class="project-detail__caption">Runway Editorial — Spring/Summer Campaign Lookbook Architecture</div>
            </div>
            <div class="project-detail__gallery-item">
              <img src="/images/projects/fragile-base/fragile_02.webp" alt="Minimalist Monochromatic Silhouette" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
              <div class="project-detail__caption">Minimalist Monochromatic Silhouette & Product Card Interaction</div>
            </div>
            <div class="project-detail__gallery-item">
              <img src="/images/projects/fragile-base/fragile_03.webp" alt="Textile Architecture and Wool Blend Drape" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
              <div class="project-detail__caption">Textile Architecture & Wool Blend Drape Sensory Zoom</div>
            </div>
            <div class="project-detail__gallery-item">
              <img src="/images/projects/fragile-base/fragile_04.webp" alt="Studio Portrait Tailoring" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
              <div class="project-detail__caption">Studio Portrait — Contemporary Tailoring & Structure Study</div>
            </div>
            <div class="project-detail__gallery-item">
              <img src="/images/projects/fragile-base/fragile_05.webp" alt="Footwear & Sculptural Leather Accessories" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
              <div class="project-detail__caption">Footwear & Sculptural Leather Accessories Showcase</div>
            </div>
            <div class="project-detail__gallery-item">
              <img src="/images/projects/fragile-base/fragile_06.webp" alt="Atelier Craftsmanship and Precision Seaming" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
              <div class="project-detail__caption">Atelier Craftsmanship & Precision Seaming Detail State</div>
            </div>
            <div class="project-detail__gallery-item">
              <img src="/images/projects/fragile-base/fragile_07.webp" alt="Lookbook Detail Deconstructed Outerwear" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
              <div class="project-detail__caption">Lookbook Detail — Deconstructed Outerwear Dynamic Grid</div>
            </div>
            <div class="project-detail__gallery-item">
              <img src="/images/projects/fragile-base/fragile_08.webp" alt="Tactile Fabric Sourcing Organic Silk" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
              <div class="project-detail__caption">Tactile Fabric Sourcing & Organic Silk Transparency</div>
            </div>
            <div class="project-detail__gallery-item">
              <img src="/images/projects/fragile-base/fragile_09.webp" alt="Monochrome Studio Study" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
              <div class="project-detail__caption">Monochrome Studio Study & Sizing Fit Guide</div>
            </div>
            <div class="project-detail__gallery-item">
              <img src="/images/projects/fragile-base/fragile_10.webp" alt="Garment Fluidity and Spatial Flow" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
              <div class="project-detail__caption">Garment Fluidity & Spatial Flow Grid Architecture</div>
            </div>
            <div class="project-detail__gallery-item">
              <img src="/images/projects/fragile-base/fragile_11.webp" alt="Campaign Vision Strength and Vulnerability" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
              <div class="project-detail__caption">Campaign Vision — Architectural Strength & Emotional Vulnerability</div>
            </div>
            <div class="project-detail__gallery-item">
              <img src="/images/projects/fragile-base/fragile_12.webp" alt="Modular Layering and Trench Study" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
              <div class="project-detail__caption">Modular Layering & Trench Study Presentation</div>
            </div>
            <div class="project-detail__gallery-item">
              <img src="/images/projects/fragile-base/fragile_13.webp" alt="Hand-Finished Edge and Seam Integrity" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
              <div class="project-detail__caption">Hand-Finished Edge & Seam Integrity Inspection</div>
            </div>
            <div class="project-detail__gallery-item">
              <img src="/images/projects/fragile-base/fragile_14.webp" alt="High-Density Knitwear Architecture" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
              <div class="project-detail__caption">High-Density Knitwear Architecture & Yarn Specifications</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="project-detail__media-single">
            <img 
              src="/images/projects/fragile-base/fragile_15.webp" 
              alt="Sculpted Collar and Asymmetric Closure"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
            <div class="project-detail__caption">Sculpted Collar & Asymmetric Closure — Runway Climax Silhouette</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- SECTION 4: IMPACT & KEY OUTCOMES -->
      <section class="project-detail__section">
        <div class="project-detail__section-grid">
          <aside class="project-detail__section-sidebar">
            <div class="project-detail__badge">
              <span>04 / Impact</span>
            </div>
          </aside>
          <div class="project-detail__section-body">
            <h2 class="project-detail__section-headline">
              Measurable commercial lift and international critical acclaim.
            </h2>
            <p>
              By treating e-commerce not as a digital vending machine but as the digital flagship of a physical atelier, Fragile Base successfully expanded into European and North American markets while establishing lasting customer loyalty.
            </p>

            <div class="project-detail__metrics-row">
              <div class="project-detail__metric-box">
                <div class="metric-number">+48%</div>
                <div class="metric-desc">Mobile Conversion Rate Increase</div>
              </div>
              <div class="project-detail__metric-box">
                <div class="metric-number">-32%</div>
                <div class="metric-desc">Product Return Rate on Sizing Inquiries</div>
              </div>
              <div class="project-detail__metric-box">
                <div class="metric-number">3.8x</div>
                <div class="metric-desc">Longer Engagement Time in Lookbook Stories</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- PROJECT FOOTER NAVIGATION -->
      <nav class="project-detail__nav-footer" aria-label="Project pagination">
        <a href="/work/xtoken-brand">← Previous: xToken Brand</a>
        <a href="/work">All Selected Works</a>
        <a href="/work/netto">Next: Netto Marken-Discount →</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
